<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia retail trade picking up - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia retail trade picking up - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's retail trade had begun to pick after a flat Christmas season, Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm hearing from retailers that January was a much better month and February (is) again starting to pick up,&quot; Costello told Sydney radio 2UE.</p>
</text>
